 "influenced_by": ["flow-matic"],
 "level_notes": {"1": "ISO/IEC 1989:2023 is paywalled and no legitimate free draft is published; the original CODASYL COBOL-60 report is freely available (bitsavers). Vendor language references (IBM Enterprise COBOL, Micro Focus) are the practical references.", "0": "GnuCOBOL (translates COBOL to C) is the main open-source implementation; it is developed on SourceForge (blocked from the verification sandbox), so file links use the OCamlPro/gnucobol GitHub mirror (gcos4gnucobol-3.x branch)."},
